 locations, we can gather data on almost all the areas inside.","nextNodeIds":[721150306]},{"nodeId":721150306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","textMapHash":4225651042,"text":"Hmm, you know, if we set up purifying devices in these locations, our troubles would be over overnight.","nextNodeIds":[721150307]},{"nodeId":721150307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","textMapHash":3474792186,"text":"If Mr. Flois knew half of what had happened here, he'd go completely ballistic...","nextNodeIds":[721150311]},{"nodeId":721150311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","textMapHash":3603995682,"text":"Alright, thanks for your help. Please take these as compensation.","nextNodeIds":[721150312]},{"nodeId":721150312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","textMapHash":2111413914,"text":"Ahem, one other thing... I may possibly, probably, definitely need you to help me retrieve the beacons again at some point over the next few days.","nextNodeIds":[721150313]},{"nodeId":721150313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","textMapHash":3606941722,"text":"I don't have a Vision, after all, so I can't simply stroll into somewhere with such a high concentration of Tatarigami energy.","nextNodeIds":[721150314]},{"nodeId":721150314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","textMapHash":37643618,"text":"Not to mention that those, hmm, rough-and-tough Fatui folks are still there. I honestly think you are the only person on this whole island capable of dealing with them and the furnace at the same time.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721150308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1371862522,"text":"Are these beacons for sale?","nextNodeIds":[721150309]},{"nodeId":721150309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","textMapHash":298108746,"text":"You jest! Even if I sold them to you, what would I use then?","nextNodeIds":[721150310]},{"nodeId":721150310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","textMapHash":3916879330,"text":"Seriously, though, if you ever visit Fontaine, I can put you in touch with someone who will sell them to you at a very fair price.","nextNodeIds":[721150311]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7211503,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133213108,3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INIT_TIME_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3162","SELECT_NPC_NONE"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7211501,7211502,7211503],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"Xavier","count":43},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":13}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[172115],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":585506550,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_RANK_ZERO_WQ","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"